B.Ub=s([B.M2],t.J)
B.LH=new A.cB("Concerned Stranger",B.Ub)
B.Uu=s(["The fortress harbor opens, and the Royal Navy sails out to meet you.","Gilded warships spread across the channel beneath British flags, forming a wall between your fleet and the island.","Neither armada turns away."],t.s)
