B.LP=new A.cB("Player",B.RD)
B.TZ=s(["You awake beneath clean blankets in an unfamiliar bedroom. Your wound aches beneath fresh bandages.","Unsteady but determined, you rise from the bed and find your footing. Your limbs scream in pain, but your mind screams louder.","You hear a firm knock on the door."],t.s)
